# Sword of the Meek, destroyed by Bot1's own Disenchant, watches from the graveyard: when Bot1 casts Llanowar Elves (a 1/1)
# on turn 3, the trigger lets Bot1 return the Sword to the battlefield attached to it, making the Elves a 2/3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Sword of the Meek
Disenchant
Llanowar Elves
Forest x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
